Z||000000||Reckard||06-29-99||11:04 AM||||I have an 84 SE with cruise that does nothing.  There is vaccum in the line going to it.  When I push in on the diaphram with the throttle cable attached it moves in and out but you can here air hissing.  Any suggestions would be appreciated.<p>Thanks<p>
